Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 5.0 096/262] e1000e: Fix -Wformat-truncation warnings
Date:   Wed, 27 Mar 2019 13:59:11 -0400
Message-Id: <20190327180158.10245-96-sashal@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.19.1
In-Reply-To: <20190327180158.10245-1-sashal@kernel.org>
